{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Limit all political offices to sole British citizens, no dual citizens",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "The Government should legislate to allow only British citizens to stand for the UK Parliament and councillor positions in England. No dual citizenship allowed. They must also be able to speak and write English to a satisfactory level.",
